--- !u!114 &841583471
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 841583468}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 938bce3e002374969865d295696cb263, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  newMusicClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: b72a8d8a4b6e84e7fb14fe298da0f998, type: 3}
  oldMusicClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: d828d4777b7d64e858738054479b512e, type: 3}
  focuspos: {fileID: 1943522138}
  vcam: {fileID: 1981717675}
  player: {fileID: 1301995486}
  dialogues:
  - '* You hear a whirr of commotion. '
  - "So\u2026you\u2019re telling me the wizard just\u2026disappeared, and he hasn\u2019t
    returned for days? "
  - 'Yes. '
  - "But\u2026it\u2019s not too absurd, y\u2019know. Maybe he just went to get some
    milk. "
  - "In that case, HE\u2019S GETTING MILK FROM THE DAMN MILKY WAY, \u2018CUZ IT\u2019S
    TAKING HIM WAY TOO LONG!!! "
  - "My bro, pull yourself together. You\u2019re all over the place right now. "
  - 'Right. Sorry. '
  names:
  - 
  - 3Y3Z
  - B3AK
  - 3Y3Z
  - B3AK
  - 3Y3Z
  - B3AK
  effects: 04000000040000000400000004000000010000000400000002000000
  dialogues2:
  - "Maybe he\u2019s transfigured into an ant. Last time he did that to feel what
    it was like to be eaten by an anteater. "
  - "He\u2019d never do it twice after getting seasick inside its large intestine. "
  - "Huh\u2026oh! Isn\u2019t that Eve? "
  names2:
  - 3Y3Z
  - B3AK
  - 3Y3Z
  effects2: 040000000400000004000000
  dialogues3:
  - 'Eve!!! Eve, you gotta listen to me. Wizard Astra has disappeared! Have you seen
    him anywhere?? '
  - Eve, I think this robot is nuts. Well, he is, well, made of nuts---
  - 'And bolts '
  - 'But this is way too much. We can try and figure something out here. '
  - "Maybe you can go to the Planet Management Facility to access all the CCTV\u2019s
    on the planet, just to make sure. "
  names3:
  - B3AK
  - 3Y3Z
  - B3AK
  - 3Y3Z
  - 3Y3Z
  effects3: 0100000004000000020000000400000004000000
  animpos: {fileID: 1507892051}
  front1: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 024b9425cfe4a4b0591935d7055e72e0, type: 3}
  front2: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 97c01479684694fdb8453f78ef1f0a4d, type: 3}
  currentstr: scene1
